The plate looks like a paper plate of about 20 cm, and it holds roughly 12 slices of browned sausage, probably smoked sausage or kielbasa. Each slice is about 4 cm across and 1.5 cm thick, which makes it around 18 g. That gives about 12 × 18 = 216 g, so I'll estimate 200 g.

Smoked sausage runs about 300 kcal per 100 g, so 200 g comes to roughly 600 kcal. The slices may be a bit smaller than I assumed, so I'll lower the estimate to about 180 g and about 540 kcal.

